12
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Change the size of the object window and match the 3D shape.

13
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Click on the Automatic Clothing Tool in the 3D tool bar.

14
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:06,000
In this way, you can quickly complete the costume cladding corresponding to the size.

15
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Next is the last size.

16
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:19,000
It is the same as the previous operation.

17
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:23,000
In this way, you can quickly complete the production of this horse-riding file.

18
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,000
In the menu bar, find Production and select Check Horse.

19
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Now you can see the cladding effect of each size in one page.

20
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Example 2. When you need to use an external model,

21
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,000
