34
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:31,000
You need to draw a line on the model according to the instructions on the mouse.

35
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:33,000
First, draw a neckline.

36
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:39,000
Draw three dots on the neck.

37
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Next is the neckline.

38
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:48,000
It is also the same creation method.

39
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:53,000
Follow the same method to complete the rest of the parts.

40
