Automatically create a costume cladding on the bottom of the list.

42
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,000
Click on the button below the list to create a costume cladding.

43
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:11,000
You can complete the manual creation of the costume cladding.

44
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:16,000
After the creation is completed, click Save.

45
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:20,000
You can save the model with the costume cladding.

